From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:16:49 +0800
Subject: session-ui: subagent cards for child sessions a Code Mode run drove
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The subagent tool's card moves into ChildSessionCard: spinner while the child session
runs, its name and task, and a tap opens the child session's live transcript. The
subagent tool renders it as before. An execute row whose nested calls recorded child
sessions (patch core/codemode-child-sessions; octopi workers) shows one card per child
session under the code, titled from the session title ("name · task"). Such an execute
call is placed like a subagent call in the timeline (the "Subagents" category).

Ocelot-Patch: web/child-session-cards

